  <%= iv_spd4_nom_time_cond_removal %>,                    !- Speed 4 Nominal Time for Condensate Removal to Begin {s}
  <%= iv_spd4_ratio_moisture_evap_rate %>,           !- Speed 4 Ratio of Initial Moisture Evaporation Rate and steady state Latent Capacity
